SUMMARY:Western Wednesdays Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Hellllooo May! We’re kicking it off with a bang! @heartsgonesouth ‘s annual birthday show for Tricia\, teaming up with @tannerthehillhippie crossing over the mountain from Nashville! $15 at the door\, 9pm\, 21 and up @the_double_crown\n\n\nWestern Wednesdays Asheville | Est. 2017 – Every Wednesday | The Double Crown – Asheville\, NC\n\nDon’t miss the best Honky Tonk in Asheville!\n**DOORS AT 8PM – $10 0ne Band | $15 Two Bands ** \n  \nThe Double Crown – Great vibes\, great bourbon\, and great music! (21+ only\, dog friendly) A West Asheville institution\, the Double Crown hosts Western Wednesdays\, karaoke\, DJ’s and rousing Gospel & Soul night’s each month. It’s a great place for an intimate evening of dancing\, drinks and fun\, especially if you love a good dive bar.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/western-wednesdays-asheville-w-rob-leines-2-2-2-2-2/
LOCATION:The Double Crown West Asheville\, 375 West Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
