SUMMARY:Golden Hour: Thursdays at The Mule
DESCRIPTION:This is what we mean by “Keep It Fresh. Drink It In.”.  Thursdays April through August\, we’re settin’ the almost-weekend vibes on our patio with a live DJ\, local beverage partners\, and interactive experiences. Each month will highlight a different local craft beverage brand\, and they’ll be here offering samples and giveaways! You’ll also have the opportunity to sink into an interactive craft experience\, take advantage of our rotating Build Your Own bar\, and shake off the day to the different sounds of our rotating DJ lineup. \nThis is free to attend\, and sure to be your Thursday go-to for Spring & Summer. \n  \n\n\n‘The Mule’ – Tasting Room \n\n\n\n\n\nSay hello to The Mule – a full-service bar/event space in the home of Devil’s Foot Beverage’s production facility. Draft soda\, beer\, & wine – as well as delicious cocktails & mocktails featuring Devil’s Foot craft sodas and the largest collection of NC-made spirits in Asheville – all at your fingertips just outside of Biltmore Village! Open now for all of your beverage & party needs! devilsfootbrew.com/the-mule
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/golden-hour-thursdays-at-the-mule/2026-05-07/
LOCATION:The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages\, 131 Sweeten Creek Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_5177-e1777940549418.jpeg
GEO:35.5588369;-82.5218977
