UID:10059308-1778176800-1778187600@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Country Club Thursdays!
DESCRIPTION:Head to the showroom for live country and southern rock\, partnered up with $5 beer\, $10 old-Fashioned & espresso martini specials! No cover. \nDoors 5PM\nBands ⬇️ 6PM \nTHUR 5/7 Connor Hunt Duo\nTHUR 5/14 Laron Huntley\nTHUR 5/21 Fancy and The Femmes\nTHUR 5/28 Prime Country \n  \nFitz\, she’s the party. Wolfe\, he’s the epicure. 2 levels\, 3 vibes. 🎶 Live Music |🍸Sips & Noms 🥪 | 🕹️ Artcade | 🗝️Speakeasy | Private Events \nFitz and the Wolfe is a cocktail and music venue shaped by the spirit of improvisation\, storytelling\, and the kind of nights that feel too good to end. Here\, every night brings a new soundtrack. Jazz\, swing\, honky-tonk\, and sometimes things a little more esoteric—if it moves people\, we book it. The music fills the space like a second heartbeat\, sometimes rowdy\, sometimes intimate\, always memorable. It’s not background noise. It’s the reason you’re here. fitzandthewolfe.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/country-club-thursdays/2026-05-07/
LOCATION:Fitz and the Wolfe\, 1 Battery Park Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-25-092304-e1777123589663.png
GEO:35.5954515;-82.5548502
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Fitz and the Wolfe 1 Battery Park Ave Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1 Battery Park Ave:geo:-82.5548502,35.5954515
END:VEVENT
